    rdfs:label "Draft: Three published findings connect potassium channels to fin size in zebrafish and to fin proportion in flying fishes, and each was verified against its PubMed abstract: kcnk5b gain of function enlarges fins, longfin overexpresses kcnh2a, and Daane 2021 implicates lat4a with kcnh2a in flying-fish fin proportion" ;
